<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="text-page"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>ELSEWHERE ARCHIVE</h1><p>ELSEWHERE ARCHIVE is an artwork and ongoing archive initiated by Marco Spitzbarth. It brings together postcard-sized contributions from different contributors and places.</p><p>Physical cards are registered, editioned and collected into a growing archive. The project explores place, origin, distance, association and the idea of “elsewhere”.</p><p>Edition 01 begins in 2026. This temporary introduction will be expanded as the project develops.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
